    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Detect and Defend against Automated Online Threats</strong></p>\n<p>ARCaptcha is a security service that protects your website and online businesses against malicious bot attacks.</p>\n<p>ARCaptcha protects your website&#8217;s forms, pages, important information, users and customers against account takeover attacks, information theft, spam and other bot-based attacks.</p>\n<p><strong>Supporting list</strong>:</p>\n<p>✔ Login form<br />\n✔ Register form<br />\n✔ Forgot password form<br />\n✔ Comments form<br />\n✔ CF7 plugin<br />\n✔ Sign-in form in WooCommerce Plugin<br />\n✔ Sign-up form in WooCommerce Plugin<br />\n✔ Forgot password form in WooCommerce Plugin<br />\n✔ Purchase form in WooCommerce Plugin<br />\n✔ Track order form in WooCommerce Plugin<br />\n✔ WPForm Plugin<br />\n✔ ElementorPro Plugin<br />\n✔ Digits Plugin</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Register on the www.ARCaptcha.co/en, after registering, the private keys of your website will be available to you</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Now install the WordPress plugin and enter the key information on the settings page</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.14</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested compatibility with WordPress 7.0</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Stable version of plugin</li>\n<li>Added support for Contact form 7</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added support for digits</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added invisible option in default forms</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Enables ARCaptcha integration with WordPress.",
